<http://data.silknow.org/production/a3cb082d-a9b8-3f9a-9b47-b8b7275795ef>
        a                       ecrm:E12_Production ;
        ecrm:P108_has_produced  <http://data.silknow.org/object/ee3cbce5-fa6b-3af8-be77-b85e49110416> ;
        ecrm:P126_employed      "Woven silk - cream satin gathered with supplementary weft of black for Clubs and Spades, red for Hearts and Diamonds, and four or five colours for the Court cards: black, blue, green, red and beige. The one exception is the King of Hearts which has additional red.\n\nEtching on paper - backs consist of an etching of a halbedier supporting the arms of the Grand Dukes of Tuscany wrapped round the woven silk card."@en , "paper"@en , "printing ink"@en ;
